1
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:12,360
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,620
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:21,960
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,480
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:32,220
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:36,090
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:39,560
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,810
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,560
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,100
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,980
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,360
=Episode 11=

15
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,079
Everyone,

16
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,159
until we meet again
in the martial world.

17
00:01:09,879 --> 00:01:10,920
He's finally gone.

18
00:01:11,439 --> 00:01:14,239
Our sect can finally have some peace.

19
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:18,200
What a shame.

20
00:01:18,799 --> 00:01:19,799
What's such a shame about it?

21
00:01:20,319 --> 00:01:22,840
He withstood three lashes
from the Dragon Sinew Whip

22
00:01:23,079 --> 00:01:25,760
and broke the Demon-Suppressing Beast's
fighting spirit.

23
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:28,959
He will go far.

24
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,400
Go far?

25
00:01:30,719 --> 00:01:31,400
Ridiculous.

26
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:33,359
I was just holding back.

27
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:35,200
He was simply lucky.

28
00:01:36,079 --> 00:01:37,280
Besides, we already have

29
00:01:37,519 --> 00:01:40,439
a peerless genius,
our Young Sect Master.

30
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:43,000
Why lament over a mere loser?

31
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,280
Enough.

32
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,959
Our top priority now

33
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,480
is to devise a suitable cultivation plan

34
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,000
for Cuihua,

35
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:51,280
so she can make a name for herself

36
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:52,640
at the sect tournament.

37
00:01:53,599 --> 00:01:54,480
Yes, Sect Master.

38
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,480
Yes, Sect Master.

39
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:56,319
Yes, Sect Master.

40
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,359
Dismissed.

41
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:08,393
(Heavenly Sword Sect)

42
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:11,080
It was crafted
by the founder of our sect

43
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,120
and has stood for a thousand years.

44
00:02:12,719 --> 00:02:14,360
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
Why would it shatter today?

45
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:15,840
This is bad.

46
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:16,479
This...

47
00:02:16,719 --> 00:02:18,400
this is surely an ill omen!

48
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:19,400
(Was it)

49
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:21,400
(because Zhao Feiyang left?)

50
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,520
(Dear,)

51
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,439
(you're back.)

52
00:03:00,879 --> 00:03:02,080
(I can't give you a future.)

53
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,240
(I'm not worthy of all your kindness.)

54
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,400
(If I don't treat you well now,)

55
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,719
(who else should I?)

56
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,159
The Nether Hall is powerful.

57
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:28,479
If I want to destroy it,

58
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,479
I must possess even greater power.

59
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,759
On the Shenwu Continent,

60
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:34,599
cultivation realms are divided into:

61
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:35,800
Body Tempering Realm,

62
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:37,080
Spirit Awakening Realm,

63
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,319
Spirit Burst Realm,

64
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:39,719
Minor Perfection Realm,

65
00:03:40,159 --> 00:03:41,319
Greater Perfection Realm,

66
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,800
Earthly Immortal Realm,

67
00:03:43,199 --> 00:03:44,120
and True Immortal Realm.

68
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,039
The Nether Hall Master

69
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:48,159
is truly at the Earthly Immortal Realm.

70
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:50,280
I'm three major realms below him.

71
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,159
Even if I consider myself gifted,

72
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:56,879
I doubt I could reach his level

73
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,759
in less than a century.

74
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:02,080
Perhaps the three Sword Immortals
were right.

75
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:04,159
The path of the sword

76
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:07,240
may be my only chance.

77
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:33,439
It's time to visit
Sword Immortal Island.

78
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:36,040
But before that,

79
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:39,240
I need to visit the Chen family first.

80
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,120
Qiushui,

81
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:44,519
(Chen Family, Tianxuan Kingdom)
What are your plans now?

82
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,839
Tianxuan Kingdom is uniting

83
00:04:46,839 --> 00:04:48,800
all forces in the Southern Domain
of the Shenwu Continent.

84
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:51,519
They are giving me their full support.

85
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:53,839
I need to improve
my cultivation quickly.

86
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,519
In a few days, I'll head
to Sword Immortal Island.

87
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:59,319
If I can grasp
one Sword Immortal's sword intent,

88
00:04:59,639 --> 00:05:01,160
it should greatly boost

89
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:02,519
my cultivation.

90
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:04,480
Seeing how steadfast your Dao heart is,

91
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:05,959
I can rest easy now.

92
00:05:07,279 --> 00:05:09,040
But I heard

93
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,480
you're still looking for Zhao Feiyang.

94
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,279
You even admitted

95
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,519
that he was your fiancé
at the Heavenly Sword Sect.

96
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,040
He died.

97
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,439
He died?

98
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:21,240
That's actually good news.

99
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,240
That way,
you can strengthen your Dao heart

100
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,759
and go even further.

101
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:26,360
Report!

102
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,360
Patriarch, Zhao Feiyang is here.

103
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,120
Zhao Feiyang?

104
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,360
Didn't you say he was dead?

105
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:36,800
I don't know what happened either.

106
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,279
Tell him to get out.

107
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:40,240
Yes.

108
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,000
Zhao Feiyang?

109
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:53,319
I'm here today to ask you something.

110
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,319
Did you send someone to assassinate Bai?

111
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,319
Yes.

112
00:06:03,319 --> 00:06:05,120
I thought you'd at least try to deny it.

113
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:08,439
Didn't expect you
to admit it so readily.

114
00:06:10,759 --> 00:06:11,319
Fine.

115
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:12,879
Today,

116
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,680
I'll settle every score
with the Chen family

117
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,600
once and for all.

118
00:06:19,519 --> 00:06:20,079
Zhao Feiyang,

119
00:06:20,639 --> 00:06:21,519
don't do anything rash.

120
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,600
I've refined the divine-grade Dao Bone

121
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,319
and reached Stage 1
of the Spirit Burst Realm.

122
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,079
You're no match for me.

123
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:28,720
I don't want to hurt you.

124
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,480
So think this through.

125
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,079
I did it for your own good.

126
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,720
For my own good?

127
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:35,160
For the past three years,

128
00:06:35,839 --> 00:06:36,879
your meridians have been ruined

129
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,040
and you've lost your Dao Bone.

130
00:06:38,279 --> 00:06:39,319
What makes you think

131
00:06:39,519 --> 00:06:41,000
a beautiful woman

132
00:06:41,199 --> 00:06:42,680
would stay by your side

133
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,399
and take care of you

134
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,600
day and night?

135
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:46,639
Perhaps it's because...

136
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,240
Don't give me that true love nonsense.

137
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,160
There's no such thing in this world.

138
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:52,720
Never once did you suspect her?

139
00:06:53,439 --> 00:06:54,680
I was afraid you'd get hurt,

140
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:56,360
so I sent someone to test her.

141
00:06:56,959 --> 00:06:59,399
Don't you understand I meant well?

142
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,680
Chen Qiushui,

143
00:07:06,399 --> 00:07:08,040
you're really good at making excuses.

144
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,800
But however you spin it,

145
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:13,240
you can't change what you did.

146
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:15,480
I'll admit to everything I've done.

147
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:16,480
However,

148
00:07:16,879 --> 00:07:17,800
the person I sent

149
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:19,040
has been missing ever since.

150
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:20,839
Given Qingzhu's loyalty to me,

151
00:07:20,959 --> 00:07:21,920
if she'd succeeded,

152
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,399
she would've reported back to me.

153
00:07:23,759 --> 00:07:24,959
She wouldn't have simply vanished.

154
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:25,639
So,

155
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,360
I was right to test her.

156
00:07:27,959 --> 00:07:28,720
That woman

157
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,000
is no ordinary person.

158
00:07:31,279 --> 00:07:32,439
I'll leave what happened to Bai

159
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,639
unsettled for now.

160
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,439
Once I get to the bottom of this,

161
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,360
I'll come back to settle it.

162
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,040
Did I say you could leave?

163
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,160
Father,

164
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:43,319
please don't make things hard for him.

165
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,240
He came here to cause trouble

166
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:47,439
and make threats.

167
00:07:48,079 --> 00:07:49,399
If I don't teach him a lesson,

168
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,160
and word gets out,

169
00:07:51,439 --> 00:07:53,079
our Chen family will be a laughingstock!

170
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:55,759
As the patriarch,

171
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,759
don't I have a reputation to uphold?

172
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:58,480
Zhao Feiyang,

173
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:00,120
apologize to my father

174
00:08:00,319 --> 00:08:01,319
and we'll let this go.

175
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,040
Fine.

176
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,920
For Qiushui's sake,

177
00:08:05,279 --> 00:08:06,319
I can forgive you.

178
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,680
But first, get on your knees

179
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:10,360
and crawl out.

180
00:08:10,639 --> 00:08:11,839
Then it's over.

181
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:13,839
And if I don't?

182
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:16,120
Then I'll break your legs

183
00:08:16,519 --> 00:08:17,639
as punishment!

184
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:20,839
Chen Bin,

185
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:22,839
you old dog!

186
00:08:23,439 --> 00:08:25,360
You cast aside our families' old ties.

187
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,360
When my Zhao family fell,

188
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:29,079
you ripped out my Dao Bone.

189
00:08:29,439 --> 00:08:31,600
And now you have the nerve
to bark at me?

190
00:08:31,759 --> 00:08:32,320
How dare you?

191
00:08:32,759 --> 00:08:34,159
Father, don't kill him.

192
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,559
It'll look bad if word gets out.

193
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,720
Killing him

194
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:39,399
would only bring shame upon me.

195
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,639
But teaching him a lesson

196
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,240
is absolutely necessary.

197
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:03,960
I'm at Stage 9 of the
Spirit Awakening Realm.

198
00:09:04,559 --> 00:09:06,519
How could I possibly lose

199
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:09,759
to a loser who just started over?

200
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:13,840
No, Zhao Feiyang!

201
00:09:21,519 --> 00:09:23,039
You ripped out my Dao Bone.

202
00:09:25,039 --> 00:09:25,759
Now it's time

203
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,879
to settle that score.

204
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:30,879
Zhao Feiyang,

205
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:31,840
no!

206
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:33,840
No!

207
00:09:36,279 --> 00:09:37,120
Zhao Feiyang!

208
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:47,750
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

209
00:09:47,907 --> 00:09:50,577
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

210
00:09:50,837 --> 00:09:54,387
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

211
00:09:54,567 --> 00:09:58,767
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

212
00:09:59,217 --> 00:10:02,467
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

213
00:10:02,837 --> 00:10:05,647
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

214
00:10:05,957 --> 00:10:09,337
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

215
00:10:09,467 --> 00:10:13,697
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

216
00:10:14,137 --> 00:10:17,267
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

217
00:10:17,557 --> 00:10:20,637
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

218
00:10:21,207 --> 00:10:24,047
♪With this flesh and soul♪

219
00:10:24,277 --> 00:10:27,297
♪I shall forge a new age♪

220
00:10:27,634 --> 00:10:30,704
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

221
00:10:30,954 --> 00:10:34,044
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

222
00:10:34,264 --> 00:10:36,494
♪At cultivation's peak♪

223
00:10:36,634 --> 00:10:40,474
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

224
00:10:40,884 --> 00:10:43,504
♪The sun and moon turn♪

225
00:10:43,524 --> 00:10:47,194
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

226
00:10:47,654 --> 00:10:54,434
♪I am the undying flame♪

227
00:10:55,114 --> 00:10:59,834
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

228
00:11:00,184 --> 00:11:03,364
♪At last I see, immortality♪

229
00:11:03,524 --> 00:11:08,164
♪Lives in your smiles♪
